  "title": "Meal Planner & Weekly Menu",
  "url": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/meal-planner-weekly-menu/id6460821436?uo=4",
  "description": "Did you know that meal planning can improve your health and mood? YouMealPlan is a beautiful all-in-one weekly meal planner that makes meal planning and preparation simple and fun.\n\nPLAN YOUR MEALS WITH A BEAUTIFUL DESIGN\nCreate weekly meal plans, organize recipes and automatically generate grocery lists. Always have your meal planner, digital recipe keeper and grocery list at your fingertips.\n\nWEEKLY MEAL PLAN\nWith this meal plan organizer, planning is quick and easy. In just a few minutes a week, you'll have your meal plan ready. Save your favorite meal plans and repeat them whenever you want.\n\nYOUR RECIPE KEEPER\nOrganize recipes, create your personal recipe book and take it with you wherever you go. Your recipe collection will be your best ally in maintaining a balanced diet and healthy eating habits.\n\nSMART GROCERY LIST\nTurn meal plan ingredients into an automatic grocery list. Add only what you need, reduce food waste and save money. It's perfect for your diet and budget. Also ideal for meal prep and batch cooking.\n\nSIMPLE CALORIE COUNTER\nTrack your macros without complications. The built-in calorie counter shows calories, protein, carbs, fat, fiber and sugar for your meals, so you always know what you're eating and reach your goals more easily.\n\nSAVE TIME, MONEY AND FOOD\n- Reduce your budget by shopping with purpose\n- Stop wasting food (how many times have you bought onions you already had?)\n- Sync with your family and share recipes and meal plans easily\n- A great companion for intermittent fasting or keto diet planning\n\nFREE AND AD-FREE\nYou can use the weekly planner, save recipes and organize grocery lists without ads or cost. The premium version supports development and unlocks multiple weekly meal plans, custom templates and unlimited sync.\n\nDOWNLOAD NOW AND TRANSFORM YOUR DIET\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/",
