  "releaseNotes": "- MAGIC RECIPE IMPORTER: Paste a web link and get the recipe data in seconds.\n\n- Offline mode! Keep planning without an internet connection—everything syncs when you're back online.\n\n- Body weight and water tracker.\n\n- Set different nutrition goals for each day of the week.\n\n- Add daily reminders or reminders for your favorite recipes—now with an improved reminder display.\n\n- Quickly move or copy meals to another day or meal.\n\nFor any questions, problems, or suggestions, you can email me at youmealplan@gmail.com.",
